	(gr_text_box "12V DC ONLY!\n\nThe IRQ LED indicates hardware interrupt requests from the sensor array. The SCLK LED indicates bus transactions between the ESP and the bridge array. \n\nSTATUS LED is script activated (GPIO21). Trigger or blink this for software status codes.\n\nSee schematic for info."
